# Fabric and test policy

- **Do not change existing Skript tests.** Leave test scripts and test names as they are.
- **All script tests must pass on the Fabric version.** The Fabric test run (`./gradlew quickTestFabric`) must complete with no test failures. Fix regressions by changing implementation or Fabric-specific code, not by modifying or skipping tests.
- **Only change Java code in the Fabric port.** Do not modify Java in `skript-core/`, `skript-bukkit/`, or the root project `src/main/java/`. All Java changes must be confined to `skript-fabric/`.
